WEBVTT

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.740
Can't see a thing...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.660
Ow!

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.800
Damn, what is this place?

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:10.770
Master.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.060
Over here.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.630
Meowka?!

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:20.270
Now is the time to use the Yz spell.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.780
Huh? What will that do?

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.580
The spell will allow you 
to see this world clearly.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.040
Oh, so it's like a flashlight?

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:33.450
No! Yz is a powerful spell for 
illuminating the entire world!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.270
I get it! I get it!

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.490
Yz!

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.900
Whoa! I can see! Wow!

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:41.930
Bye.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.940
Thanks, Meowka.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:48.860
We performed a ritual to seal 
away all light and sound...

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.920
That's a fascinating 
familiar you have there.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.210
Himea!

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:06.580
Haruka!

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.340
Student Council

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.810
Mirai Kick!

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:30.420
A pity.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:34.550
"Summer Vacation Catastrophe"

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:35.180
Don't forget that you can't dodge 
anything once you're airborne.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:38.660
And in battle, you are supposed to 
utilize the tools that are available to you.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.230
Trash!

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:55.260
If you expect the same trick 
to work twice, you're a fool.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.460
Don't worry.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.420
I'm no fool.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.720
Back in action!

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.240
Good grief. This was expensive.

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:23.200
Don't worry. You won't need a 
tie after I remove your head.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:26.300
I suppose I should get serious.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.080
Gekkou!

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.670
Damn!

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:43.870
You've died once.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.930
Twice, three times.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.560
Four times.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:53.480
The stupid student council president 
forgot that I can use magic.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.750
Gekkou isn't stupid!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:01.030
Just you watch! I'm gonna 
tear this guy apart!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.650
Okay, I'll kill this demon.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.020
As a demonstration.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:06.880
Wait!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.710
Wait?

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.540
Are you ordering me around?

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:17.610
I'm begging you to wait.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.110
Gekkou?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:24.120
I admit defeat.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.380
Please don't kill Mirai.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:29.890
I need you to demonstrate 
that you're sincere.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.130
No way! No way! No way!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.200
Gekkou! I can beat him!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.880
I already snapped his arm!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.410
No way! It healed!

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:49.540
You learned a valuable lesson today.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.420
It is very sad when you have no power.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:03.060
If you're upset, you simply need 
to obtain enough power to kill me.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:09.930
Gekkou...

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.940
Oh, no! Someone has broken 
through the barrier!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:25.990
You're...

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.660
Hinata!

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.940
Pathetic, dear brother.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:42.700
So you're the Spell Breakers?!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.220
I am Serge Entolio.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.110
And this is my brother, Hasga.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.980
It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.080
Give them back!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.300
Very well.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.710
However, we'll only be 
returning one of them.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.150
Haruka!

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.930
We no longer need that 
girl. Take her with you.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:09.290
Bastards! What did you do to Haruka?!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:13.500
Shigure Haruka was born unlucky.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.620
You can't imagine how bad she has it.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.820
What are you talking about?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.940
We can't tell you. Our policy is to 
protect the privacy of our clients.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:23.430
Policy?!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.760
Let's finish this then.

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.810
I'm sure that Saitohimea is happy

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.090
you're here to see this, Kurogane-kun.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:49.620
Brother, you're struggling 
against this weak opponent?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:50.690
Hinata!

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:56.460
Well, you don't stand much of a chance 
when you're still using my old stuff.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.730
Hey! Don't call me old stuff!

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:02.230
Excuse me. Mind if I say hello?

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.820
Kurosu Firiel Yuuichi.

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.410
A military agent, correct?

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:11.020
Oh, I am amazed that you know who I am.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:17.460
You're stuck with this annoying guy 
because you ignored my warning.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.810
Wouldn't you agree, Aomi Izumi-san?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.940
Am I famous or something?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:27.820
Of course. You are 
included in the prophecy.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.570
Prophecy?

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:35.540
Isn't that why you let her 
join the student council?

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.390
Prophecy...

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:39.440
You mean the prophecy 
the Seraphim spoke of?

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.830
You know so much, brother.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:46.540
But I can't tell you any more right now.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.950
What?!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:51.880
Are you here to tease Gekkou-kun?

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.860
I like the sound of that.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.890
Is that how you express 
your brotherly love?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:02.110
A person who can barely reach the 1st 
Scudel of prophecy would never understand.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.680
And how far have you gone?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.580
The 3rd Scudel.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:14.230
The feeble minds of humans are 
no match for the prophecy.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:18.350
I see why you are the Seraphim's crow.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:21.680
Now I want to make you mine.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:24.910
You should stop.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.570
You can't reach me.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.050
Oh? You're rather confident.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:47.770
Good grief. What a nasty spell.

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:50.070
These guys are...

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:56.870
Do you understand now? You're twenty 
thousand steps behind me, not ahead of me.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.470
I'll excuse myself then.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.160
The military's barrier 
should be returning soon.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.550
Wait, Hinata!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.350
Brother.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.560
I hope that you'll 
have shortened my lead

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:13.070
to ten thousand steps 
the next time we meet.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.790
Kurogane-kun is waiting.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:16.830
What?!

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.890
Himea!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:22.930
Outta my way!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.080
I don't get it.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:30.370
Aren't you sick of having that 
evil witch hanging around?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.610
We're helping you here.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.950
What did you say?!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.420
You should be happy.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:40.320
Thanks to us, you don't have to 
deal with that nasty witch anymore.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:44.080
Screw that! I won't accept it!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.050
Break!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.590
What was that...

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.140
What did you do?

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:01.560
Hasga specializes in breaking things.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.950
Breaking things?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:07.190
I broke you and the space around you.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.760
By the way, I specialize in seals.

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:14.420
That's why we're the Spell Breakers.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.250
You're just an ordinary human.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.260
Why would you volunteer to become 
this monster's plaything?

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.540
Himea is...

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.580
...not a monster!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.090
Stupid.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.060
She's only pretty on the outside.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.440
Shut up!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.260
Destroy!

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:44.970
Your attacks won't work on me.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.330
Ow!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.650
Master! Cast the spell!

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.320
Just cast the spell!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.650
Skalz!

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.020
Skalz?

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:12.060
What was that?

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.600
The terrifying curse of a cat.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:15.790
Curse?

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.450
What did you curse?

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:18.780
Magic.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.220
So what's going to happen?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.230
Beats me.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:22.790
Don't give me that!

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.740
Well, it's all yours now.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.560
Huh?! Wait! Don't mess around!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.820
You're the one messing around!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:36.530
We were offering to turn you 
back into a normal human.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.140
What's your problem?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.320
Shut up!

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.450
Destroy!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.800
We can remove your ability 
to come back to life.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:53.680
We can completely seal Saitohimea.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.550
Once that's done, you'll 
be normal again.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.880
I never asked

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.550
for your help!

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.280
Destroy!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.230
Destroy!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.150
Destroy!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.020
You look pale.

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.140
Are you out of lives now?

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:29.600
You can't die again.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.460
So tell us how you really feel.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:37.630
Do you really intend to throw away 
the rest of your life for Saitohimea?

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:43.320
Betraying your family, friends,

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.310
and Shigure Haruka-san in the process...

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.510
Your actions will betray 
the people around you

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:51.640
and cause them sorrow.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.290
I just...

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.650
...don't want to make anyone sad!

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:01.550
Stop joking.

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.510
What can you possibly do,

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.070
when you're this weak?

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.030
That's why we're offering to help you.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.260
Kurogane Taito will 
become an ordinary human

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:15.290
and return to his original 
world with Shigure Haruka.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.680
You'll forget everything 
about Saitohimea.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.280
Problem solved.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:21.540
It's very simple.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.300
I never asked for that!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.540
I'll just keep punching you 
in the face until you agree.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:38.410
Once you're willing to leave Saitohimea 
and return with Shigure Haruka,

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.900
I'll set you free.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.430
But if you refuse,

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:48.160
you're going to die permanently.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.710
Die...?

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.650
What are you doing?

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:11.040
We have these guests 
because you took too long.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.390
What? You're blaming me?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.640
It's not my fault that 
the spell is slow.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.860
Gekkou...

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:23.280
Hey, Gekkou. Immortal 
guy isn't immortal.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:29.390
The Spell Breaker brothers 
must have sealed his power.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:34.100
Hey, could you give up already?

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.080
Go home with your buddies...

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.290
I'm not leaving!

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.190
Hah? Are you crazy?

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:43.380
I know what I'm doing!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.420
I mean every word I say!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.500
Feel free to keep hitting 
me until I'm almost dead.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:52.010
You think I'm crazy?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.510
I'm so scared that I wanna run away!

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:56.360
Then run!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.570
But!

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.650
I can't run away!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:05.940
If I run away, how am I 
supposed to live with myself?!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.450
Don't give me that shit!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:14.150
Himea risked her life to 
bring me back to life.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:20.400
And you're telling me to 
run away because I may die?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.700
I can't do that!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.920
That's why I...

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.460
I...

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.720
...will use all of my power 
so nobody has to cry!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.440
Do you need help?!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.300
No thanks!

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.180
But take care of Haruka.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.450
Mirai.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.110
Got it!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:50.420
All of your power?

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.980
There are plenty of problems out there

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:55.980
that can't be solved by 
using all of your power!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.510
Are you a dumb little kid?

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:00.290
That's right. I'm a dumb little kid.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.750
So what?

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:07.280
If all of my power isn't enough, 
I just have to find some more!

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.760
If my best isn't enough, I'll 
just have to try harder!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.200
Stop with the bravado.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.990
You've done enough.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.230
But you're about to die.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.130
The next hit will kill you.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.620
So run away.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:33.820
Nobody will blame you if you run!

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:40.500
I won't run...

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:46.890
I'm going to beat you down

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.260
and take Himea

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.680
back to the school...

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.500
It's impossible!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:58.180
Then I'll do the impossible!

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:02.060
I would rather die

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:05.590
than give up without trying!

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:14.780
Gekkou?

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.280
Then die!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.510
I'm telling you that I won't die!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.950
It might make sense to 
give up in your world.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.470
But in my world, that's 
not how it works!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.020
I'm sick of seeing your faces!

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.470
Hasga!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.280
Dammit!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.140
Why you little...

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.300
Bro!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:59.390
Damn these dirty little half-breeds...

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:09.120
I won't give up.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.340
Won't give up...

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:16.190
I'll keep trying... Keep trying...

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:17.350
Until I have...

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.470
...everything I want!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:26.980
Give back

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.400
Himea!

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.890
Gekkou...

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.100
I'll take over from here.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:12.130
Bro, I'm sick of dealing 
with these guys.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:16.510
I understand. It won't take much 
longer to finish sealing her. Then...

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.490
That won't happen.

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:20.660
Impossible!

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:23.030
She broke my spell?!

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:26.870
I already deciphered your spell.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:32.920
Impossible... My seal can never 
be broken by the target...

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:37.050
A curse on magic...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:41.300
That's what it meant?!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.700
Begone!

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:54.320
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.330
Taito.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.580
Himea.

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:17.580
Sorry, Taito...

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.790
This is all my fault...

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:27.470
Hold on. I'm going to kill them.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.250
Run,

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:36.730
Hasga...

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.720
Bro!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.370
Hasga!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.040
Himea.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.090
Taito?

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:58.150
It's okay...

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.110
We don't need to bother with them.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.720
Taito...

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.150
Himea, let's go back...

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.850
Together...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.160
Okay.

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:14.920
I feel really good, so it's okay.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:20.480
Hey, Gekkou. Is this a miracle of love?

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.340
How would I know?!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.250
Hey, Saitohimea!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.490
Is this your doing?

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:33.250
Yes, I translocated the spell, so this 
dimension will disappear shortly.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:35.480
What a pain.

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:37.590
I'm going back to the 
student council office.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.940
Ah. Wait, Gekkou!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.160
Let's go, Himea.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.310
We've failed our contract.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:55.880
Yeah... He reminds me 
of how you used to be.

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:57.330
Really?

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:00.210
He actually reminded me of you.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.310
Seriously?

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:27.290
Whoo-hoo! It's summer vacation time!

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.890
Hey, let's do some shopping for 
the trip before we go home?

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:34.890
Summer Vacation Time

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:35.300
The military altered the memories 
of everyone who was involved,

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.460
so that Haruka's kidnapping 
never occurred.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:43.410
Apparently, Haruka didn't remember 
anything about the incident either.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.900
Hmm? Taito?

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:50.240
Well, it's better this way.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.500
What? What's wrong?

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.130
Nah, it's nothing.

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:58.850
Please take a picture with me!

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.270
Do you have any plans?

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:02.330
What? Is it Gekkou again?

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:03.870
Serge-sama!

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:05.800
Ooh, Hasga-kun!

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:13.970
Student Council

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:15.250
What are those guys doing here?!

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.210
The worthless military hired them.

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:20.730
Hah?! That doesn't answer my question!

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:25.430
I'll explain it so your 
feeble brain can understand.

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:30.560
Their employer, the church, has made it 
difficult for them to find more work,

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:34.290
so they'll be staying here 
until things have settled down.

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:36.830
You must be kidding...

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:39.130
Don't worry, Taito.

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:42.060
If they try anything,

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:44.410
I'll kill them.

00:22:46.660 --> 00:22:49.680
Taito, are you done with your work?

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.100
Let's go home together.

00:22:55.360 --> 00:22:58.410
I'll be waiting by the stairs.

00:22:58.410 --> 00:22:59.840
Oh, yeah...

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:02.870
You mean the world to me, Taito.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:04.640
I love you.

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:10.650
Hurry up!

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:23.310
It's okay, Taito.

00:23:23.310 --> 00:23:25.790
I didn't hear anything.

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.350
You heard everything!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.300
This is gonna be one hot summer.

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:36.050
Pool, pool, swim, swim.

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.640
Hey, Taito.

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:42.560
Do you like her more than you like me?

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:44.600
I-It's not like that!

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:46.730
This is a stupid turn of events.

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:51.110
Gekkou, you bastard!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.150
Taito, do you really mean it?

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:55.050
Yes, I do!

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:56.460
You really, really mean it?

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:59.940
Absolutely! 120% true!

00:23:59.940 --> 00:24:03.850
But is it really, really, really true?

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:09.230
Yeah, it's really, really, 
really, really true!

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.100
I need to talk with you.

00:24:12.100 --> 00:24:12.860
I don't.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:13.230
You see...

00:24:13.230 --> 00:24:14.480
I said that I don't.

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:15.930
Hey, Taito! Hold me!

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:18.790
Wait, Himea! This isn't 
the time for that!

00:24:18.790 --> 00:24:20.380
Hey. If you don't have 
any business with me,

00:24:20.380 --> 00:24:21.620
get out of the student council office.

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:23.760
Ta-da! Mirai-chan's here!

00:24:23.760 --> 00:24:26.520
Hey, Gekkou! Guess what? I'm hungry!

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.760
Will you listen to what I'm saying?

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:29.230
Is it time to hold me yet? Well?

00:24:29.230 --> 00:24:30.150
Not yet!

00:24:30.150 --> 00:24:33.260
Hold me! What? Lemme join in!

00:24:33.260 --> 00:24:36.940
Just shut up! Fine then! The 
student council is disbanded!

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:41.520
Next Time: "Pale White Graduation"

00:24:36.940 --> 00:24:37.790
I'll hold Gekkou!

00:24:37.790 --> 00:24:39.590
Stupid! Stop it!
